# Default reviewers for pull requests that arrive without one.
#
# THIS IS A BACKSTOP, NOT THE REVIEW MODEL. Internal work is reviewed by
# the verifier named on the objective that produced it — the verifier is
# named per piece of work, not fixed by repository, and is regularly
# someone who is not a collaborator here. A CODEOWNERS entry cannot
# express that and should not try to. What it is for is the case
# CODEOWNERS is actually good at: a pull request from outside that model,
# which otherwise sits with nobody's name on it.
